不行，就是价格便宜一半。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18146705\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/438f1f9a246a590cae1bba48e9429da6?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"adtxl\" data-uid=\"461656\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>5</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/adtxl\">adtxl</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-03 19:04:48 +08:00\">19h 9m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>老哥订阅这么多，是独立开发者有收入，还是单纯的消费呢</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18146901\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/ca8de5ce310c84ec0abf08eb3f12b068?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"Tory12138\" data-uid=\"818002\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>9</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Tory12138\">Tory12138</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-03 21:53:06 +08:00\">16h 21m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>grok 体验感怎么样，和 Claude 相比有哪些好玩的或者独特的地方吗</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18146906\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/a8eb/0af2/503692_normal.png?m=1781236811\" alt=\"rimworld\" data-uid=\"503692\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>10</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/rimworld\">rimworld</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>OP</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-03 21:55:15 +08:00\">16h 19m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/Tory12138\">Tory12138</a> grok 不太行，本来想等 4.7 来个大的，结果拉了。但是送的有 cursor 的 ultra ，我主要是用 cursor 的 ultra 然后用第三方模型，还是用 claude 的 opus 模型来干活。目前 grok 就是用来搜 x 里的内容了。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18146909\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/ca8de5ce310c84ec0abf08eb3f12b068?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"Tory12138\" data-uid=\"818002\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>11</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Tory12138\">Tory12138</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-03 21:57:18 +08:00\">16h 17m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/rimworld\">rimworld</a> #10 哦这个是不是还送 x premium ，主要搜 x 的什么呢，因为我 x 玩的少，只是看一下 ai 最新的动态，所以想请教一下 x 的玩法</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18146995\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/a8eb/0af2/503692_normal.png?m=1781236811\" alt=\"rimworld\" data-uid=\"503692\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>12</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/rimworld\">rimworld</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>OP</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-03 23:04:33 +08:00\">15h 9m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/Tory12138\">Tory12138</a> 是的，还送 x 的会员。看你用 x 干什么。我是让他帮我总结 x 内最近流行的讨论热点什么的。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18146996\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/6f7b/82ab/346271_normal.png?m=1740789816\" alt=\"zfyime\" data-uid=\"346271\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>13</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/zfyime\">zfyime</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-03 23:04:53 +08:00\">15h 9m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>平均每个月上千了吧<br>工资一个月得好几万吧</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18147028\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/c748/bacf/466135_normal.png?m=1775815236\" alt=\"dcncy\" data-uid=\"466135\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>14</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/dcncy\">dcncy</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-03 23:46:45 +08:00\">14h 27m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>5 个 team 席位 45 刀，在哪里上车？</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18147061\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/92699c48c8ccd17d47409bef8f1794be?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"xing7673\" data-uid=\"129118\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>15</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/xing7673\">xing7673</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-04 00:26:02 +08:00\">13h 48m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>老马家这个能保持吗？ 999 刀的这个 heavy ？<br>能保持还是可以的，我是等着他模型能力起来这个 grok 4.7 和 o4.7 一样</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18147135\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/2007/1315/77893_normal.png?m=1790927606\" alt=\"ota\" data-uid=\"77893\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>16</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/ota\">ota</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-04 02:21:47 +08:00\">11h 52m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/rimworld\">rimworld</a> premium plus 不是有 Radar 嗎？也送 super 的，我是用到 hermes 裏做個小助手，全套走了 tts/stt,x-search ，還有 image/video gen 。不走 grok 訂閲，普通用用完全夠了。<br>vibe 的話，同樣 cc+cx ，但我會給個 oc 訂閲跑 ds 管夠做執行層。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18147256\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/a8eb/0af2/503692_normal.png?m=1781236811\" alt=\"rimworld\" data-uid=\"503692\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>18</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/rimworld\">rimworld</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>OP</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-04 09:18:54 +08:00\">4h 55m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/xing7673\">xing7673</a> ai 发展变化太大了，日新月异，明年啥局势真不好说了。不看那么远了。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18147263\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/a8eb/0af2/503692_normal.png?m=1781236811\" alt=\"rimworld\" data-uid=\"503692\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>19</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/rimworld\">rimworld</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>